"relay che accetta la posta in chiaro."

#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "config.test_transport"
msgid ""
"{variable}=test keeps mail in memory and sends none; {environment} must "
"deliver it, with sendmail or smtp."
msgstr ""
"{variable}=test tiene la posta in memoria e non ne invia; in {environment} "
